OL,3,AAfrica's richest man launches Kenya oil
OL,4,Arefinery despite land protests
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking to the BBC, Dangote, Africa's
OL,7,Frichest man, dismissed the protests as
OL,8,Fgames played by local marketers and
OL,9,Finternational players, insisting the
OL,10,Frefinery would go ahead and would be
OL,11,Fready by 2030 as planned.
